### ----------------------------------------------------
### CALL BASIC CONTROLS
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 4. Make Outbound Call (Click-to-Call)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientNumber": "08307753758",
  "grievanceId": ""
}

### 5. Pickup / Answer Call
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/pickup
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Drop / Hangup Call
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/drop
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{}

