{}

### ----------------------------------------------------
### TRANSFER, CONSULTATION & CONFERENCE
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 11. Get Available Transfer/Consult Targets (Parent Supervisor, Supervisors, CCEs)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/transfer-targets
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 12. Blind Transfer Call (Pass target user's _id)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/transfer
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": "672b123456789abcdef01234"
}

### 13. Consultation Call (Put customer on hold & consult supervisor/cce)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/consult
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": "672b123456789abcdef01234"
}

### 14. Cancel Consultation Call (Drop supervisor & return to customer)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/consult/cancel
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 15. Complete Attended Transfer (After consultation, merge customer to supervisor)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/transfer
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 16. Conference Call (Merge ongoing consult into 3-way conference OR add party)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/conference
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetUserId": "672b123456789abcdef01234"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------
### STATUS & HISTORY
### ----------------------------------------------------

### 17. Agent Status (auto-reconnects if disconnected)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/agent/status
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 18. Active Call Details
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/details
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

### 19. Call History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/telephony/call/history
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
